Files translated, parsing only:

- V2rayNG/app/src/main/java/com/v2ray/ang/fmt/FmtBase.kt
- V2rayNG/app/src/main/java/com/v2ray/ang/fmt/ShadowsocksFmt.kt
- V2rayNG/app/src/main/java/com/v2ray/ang/fmt/VmessFmt.kt
- V2rayNG/app/src/main/java/com/v2ray/ang/fmt/VlessFmt.kt
- V2rayNG/app/src/main/java/com/v2ray/ang/fmt/TrojanFmt.kt
- V2rayNG/app/src/main/java/com/v2ray/ang/fmt/Hysteria2Fmt.kt

The translation is daemon/internal/profile/sharelink.go. Android interface code was not copied.

That revision defines the tuic:// scheme and comments out the TUIC parser. The TUIC query mapping in sharelink.go uses the same query style as FmtBase and the field names of mihomo v1.19.32 TuicOption. mihomo is a separate program shipped as a binary; its license is recorded with that binary's upstream, MetaCubeX/mihomo.

